{"ref":"BDB, חוּג²","hw":"חוּג²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חוּג</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>vault, horizon</strong>; of the heavens, sea and earth <span dir=\"rtl\">חוּג שׁמים התהלך</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 22:14\" href=\"/Job.22.14\">Jb 22:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּחֻקֿוֹ חוּג על־פני תהום</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:27\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.27\">Pr 8:27</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חָקַק\" href=\"/BDB,_חָקַק\", dir=\"rtl\">חקק</a> on p. 349a); <span dir=\"rtl\">היֹשֵׁב עַל־חוּג הארץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 40:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.40.22\">Is 40:22</a>.","next":"BDB, מְחוּגָה","prev":"BDB, חוּג"}